ator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids had January to February at 46% of normal and June to July at 186%. In 2026 so far, May to June came in at 72% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 26543 had its driest year in 1955 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
